  "title": "Corned Beef and Knockwurst Sandwich",
  "description": "This warm corned beef, knockwurst, and Swiss cheese sandwich is cooked on the griddle and is an original recipe from a restaurant in Richmond, Virginia from the 1940's.",
  "authors": [
    "Brian Genest"
  ],
